    "prom9": "343 original cases: 37 accepted and 306 refused; exact normalized values and digests for accepted cases; all 3 output schemas and hashes. Includes reordered budgets, int-to-float and signed-zero normalization, Unicode whitespace and codepoint filler ceiling."
